{"id":"P047-2","subject":"P","unit":"P047","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P047-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n진공 차단기에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 화재의 위험이 있다.\n\n② 개폐시 개폐서지가 발생한다.\n\n③ 주파수의 영향을 받지 않는다.\n\n④ 조작이 쉽다.\n\n⑤ 고진공으로 전자의 확산을 이용한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1458}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음 중 흡수 열량이 가장 적은 것은?\n\n\n① 수냉벽        ② 보일러 수관\n\n③ 과열기        ④ 공기 예열기\n\n⑤ 절탄기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":315},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":657}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n파동 임피던스가 Ω인 선로에 파동임피던스가\nΩ인 변압기가 접속되어 있다. 선로로부터 900\n\nkV의 전압이 입사되었다면 접속점에서의 투과파 전압은\n\n몇 kV인가?\n\n\n① 180         ② 280\n\n③ 360         ④ 560\n\n⑤ 720","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":612},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1225}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n저항이 9Ω, 인덕턴스가 5H인 직렬회로의 특성근\n\n은?\n\n\n① 3.6          ② 1.8\n\n③ -1.8         ④ -2.4\n\n⑤ -3.6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":755}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n다음에 주어진 내용 중에서 옳은 것은?\n\n ㉠ 동일한 콘덴서를 개 직렬 연결하면, 합성정전\n\n   용량은 배가 된다.\n\n ㉡ 동일한 콘덴서를 개 병렬 연결하면, 합성정전\n   용량은 배가 된다.              \n\n ㉢ 정전용량에 의해 발생하는 정전유도전압으로 인해\n\n   통신선에 유도전류가 흐르며, 통신장해를 일으킨다.\n\n ㉣ 동일한 콘덴서 개를 직렬 연결하면, 전체 전하\n\n   량은 일정하다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉢         ② ㉡㉢\n\n③ ㉢㉣         ④ ㉠㉡㉢\n\n⑤ ㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":748},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1127},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m30-e2.webp","width":678,"height":462}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n지구가 완전 구형이고, 반지름을 6000km라고 할 때,\n\n지구의 정전용량은 몇 F인가?\n\n\n                × \n①            ②  \n                   × \n③         ④   \n\n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":634},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1422}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n전계의 단위로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n    A                         J\n①                     ②               m⦁C     C⦁m\n\n  m                A\n                                                               ③ V          ④ m⦁Ω\n\n  C⦁m\n⑤                V⦁m","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":617},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":478}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n비유전율이 인 매질 중의 전속밀도가 × Cm일\n때의 분극의 세기는 몇 Cm인가?\n\n\n① ×       ② × \n③ ×       ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":632},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":638}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n\n미분 방정식                  표시되  로\n는 계에서, 초깃값이 일 때, 시간함수 는?\n\n\n\n①          ② \n③          ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collectio