구리 > 백금 > 니켈 > 퍼멀로이\n\n④ 퍼멀로이 > 니켈 > 백금 > 구리\n\n⑤ 백금 > 니켈 > 퍼멀로이 > 구리","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":541},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":576}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n다음 설명에 대한 분극의 종류는?\n\n  영구 쌍극자를 가지는 극성 물질이 외부 전계에\n\n  의해 쌍극자가 외부전계 방향으로 배열되는 것을\n\n   말한다.\n\n\n\n① 전자분극       ② 이온분극\n\n③ 배향분극       ④ 전해분극\n\n⑤ 자연발생분극","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m37-q.webp","width":696,"height":605},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":934}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n두 자하가 각각 , × 이고,\n\n두 자하간의 거리가 3m일 때, 두 자하간에 작용하는\n\n힘의 크기는 몇 N 인가?\n\n\n                      \n①            ②     \n                 × \n③            ④    \n  × \n⑤